{"type":"message","id":"7aff4445","parentId":"421c0345","timestamp":"2026-05-26T09:23:04.545Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they sent me (the wxlee agent xiaoye) a task via WeChat (微信) and I reported an error. But I (wxlee/xiaoye) don't have a WeChat channel configured, so tasks sent through WeChat would have gone to a different agent. Let me check more sessions and logs to understand what's happening.\n\nLet me look at recent logs and check if there's a WeChat channel configured, and what the \"main\" agent has been doing recently with WeChat.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8e8c01434df741bf959943aa","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"limit":30,"includeLastMessage":true},"partialArgs":"{\"limit\": 30, \"includeLastMessage\": true}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779787342202,"responseId":"165df79df52f4fd282a0dc5ac2173fb7"}}
