: \"HEARTBEAT_OK\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779786712085,\n      \"sessionId\": \"ae4830d6-a0b9-4e7c-be03-e94198709d5a\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 24825,\n      \"estimatedCostUsd\": 0.006004559999999999,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1779786707292,\n      \"endedAt\": 1779786711865,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 4573,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/ae4830d6-a0b9-4e7c-be03-e94198709d5a.jsonl\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"group\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"origin\": {\n        \"provider\": \"feishu\",\n        \"accountId\": \"main\"\n      },\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-robot-space-多agent-群聊空间\",\n      \"lastMessagePreview\": \"<at user_id=\\\"ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\\\">Seaman_bot</at> 没事，你已经比之前进步了。明天见。\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n        \"accountId\": \"main\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779782730730,\n      \"sessionId\": \"c324e6e6-06ac-4a89-b9ec-12421b6ed964\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 33075,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1779782724823,\n      \"endedAt\": 1779782730390,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 5567,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n      \"lastAccountId\": \"main\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/c324e6e6-06ac-4a89-b9ec-12421b6ed964.jsonl\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:cron:config-backup-8am\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"label\": \"Cron: config-backup-8am\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Cron: config-backup-8am\",\n      \"lastMessagePreview\": \"备份完成。`openclaw.json` → `openclaw.json.backup-20260526`\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779782400538,\n      \"sessionId\": \"460bec63-0173-4117-b27a-ae64940e31e7\",\n      \"model\": \"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 1000000,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/460bec63-0173-4117-b27a-ae64940e31e7.jsonl\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat\",\n      \"agentId\": \"wxlee\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"openclaw-weixin\",\n      \"origin\": {\n        \"provider\": \"openclaw-weixin\",\n        \"accountId\": \"a23ee0675df2-im-bot\"\n      },\n      \"displayName\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n      \"lastMessagePreview\": \"好，从 Dockerfile 和文档中获得了完整信息。让我系统梳理。\\n\\n---\\n\\n主公，此问我已查明。OpenClaw 5.19 的 Dockerfile 基于 **Debian bookworm-slim**，基础镜像极度精简（已装 `ca-certificates curl git hostname lsof openssl procps python3 tini`）。`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` 的参数最终会传给 `apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends`。\\n\\n下面按功能领域分类，给出常用值：\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 一、浏览器自动化（Playwright/Chromium 依赖）\\n\\n若**不**设 `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1`（该参数自带 Xvfb + Playwright Chromium），则需手动补全系统库：\\n\\n```\\nlibnss3 libnspr4 libatk-bridge2.0-0 libdrm2 libatk1.0-0 libcups2 libxkbcommon0 libxcomposite1 libxdamage1 libxfixes3 libxrandr2 libgbm1 libpango-1.0-0 libcairo2 libasound2 libegl1\\n```\\n\\n> **推荐用法**：直接设 `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1` 即可，Dockerfile 有专用逻辑完成全部安装，比手动凑依赖更可靠。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 二、媒体处理（音视频/图像）\\n\\n| 用途 | 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|------|\\n| 音视频处理 | `ffmpeg` | 转码、截帧、拼接 |\\n| 图像处理 | `imagemagick imagemagick-6.q16` | 图片格式转换、resize |\\n| 图像处理(高性能) | `libvips-tools` | 比 ImageMagick 快很多 |\\n| 音频处理 | `sox` | 录音、转码、效果 |\\n| 字幕 | `libreoffice-impress` （较大） | 办公文档转图片 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 三、文件处理与格式转换\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `unzip zip` | 解压缩 |\\n| `p7zip-full` | 7z 压缩 |\\n| `unrar` | RAR 解压 |\\n| `poppler-utils` | PDF 提取文本/图像（`pdftotext`, `pdfimages`） |\\n| `pandoc` | 文档格式全能转换（Markdown→PDF→HTML…） |\\n| `rsync` | 文件同步 |\\n| `wget` | HTTP 下载工具（已有 curl，但 wget 的递归下载仍有场景） |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 四、网络与 API 调试\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `jq` | JSON 解析（配合 API 调用极常用） |\\n| `dnsutils` | `dig`, `nslookup` DNS 查询 |\\n| `netcat-openbsd` | 端口探测、TCP/UDP 转发 |\\n| `nmap` | 端口扫描、网络探测 |\\n| `iotop` | 磁盘 IO 监控 |\\n| `bridge-utils` | 网桥管理（Docker 网络调试） |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 五、数据库客户端\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `sqlite3` | SQLite 数据库客户端 |\\n| `postgresql-client` | PostgreSQL `psql` 命令行 |\\n| `default-mysql-client` | MySQL/MariaDB `mysql` 命令行 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 六、开发编译工具\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `build-essential` | `gcc g++ make` 全家桶，编译 C/C++ 扩展必需 |\\n| `cmake` | 某些 Node.js 原生模块编译需要 |\\n| `python3-venv` | Python 虚拟环境 |\\n| `python3-pip` | Python 包管理 (Dockerfile 中已提供 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES` 单独参数) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 七、中文字体（浏览器截图/PDF关键！）\\n\\n```\\nfonts-noto fonts-noto-cjk fonts-liberation\\n```\\n\\n> **⚠️ 重点提醒**：如果不装中文字体包，浏览器截图中文会显示为方块乱码。`fonts-noto-cjk`（Noto CJK）约 100MB，覆盖简繁日韩。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 八、文本编辑器与终端工具\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `vim` | 终端编辑 |\\n| `tmux` | 终端多窗口管理 |\\n| `htop` | 进程监控 |\\n| `tree` | 目录树查看 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 推荐组合参考\\n\\n**全能型（~150MB 额外空间）：**\\n```\\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\\\"ffmpeg imagemagick jq poppler-utils unzip zip rsync fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3 build-essential vim htop tree\\\"\\n```\\n\\n**轻量型（仅补核心缺失，~30MB）：**\\n```\\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\\\"jq unzip zip fonts-noto-cjk\\\"\\n```\\n\\n**浏览器 + 媒体全功能型：**\\n```bash\\nexport OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1\\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\\\"ffmpeg jq poppler-utils fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3\\\"\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 特别提醒\\n\\n1. **`OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1` 和 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` 是分开的 ARG**——浏览器依赖已在 Dockerfile 中有单独的逻辑（安装 Xvfb + Playwright Chromium），不需要在 APT_PACKAGES 里重复。\\n2. **`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES`** 也是一个独立 ARG，用来装 Python 包（如 `requests pandas aiohttp`），不要和 apt 包混在一起。\\n3. **镜像大小**：bookworm-slim 本身很小，但每装一个包都会增加体积。建议只装你当前需要用的 skill/plugin 真正需要的包，不要一次性全装。\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"openclaw-weixin\",\n        \"to\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n        \"accountId\": \"a23ee0675df2-im-bot\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779773075475,\n      \"sessionId\": \"99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9\",\n      \"model\": \"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1779772730407,\n      \"endedAt\": 1779773075474,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 345067,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"openclaw-weixin\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n      \"lastAccountId\": \"a23ee0675df2-im-bot\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9.jsonl\"\n    },\n    {\n\n⚠️ [... middle content omitted — showing head and tail ...]\n\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779649279831,\n      \"sessionId\": \"a2ed59aa-0992-4d35-8010-de7361f1d54a\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 15027,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/a2ed59aa-0992-4d35-8010-de7361f1d54a.jsonl\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:dreaming-narrative-rem-6451747cfdbf-1779649222595\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"lastMessagePreview\": \"The server hums a little differently tonight. Somewhere between the lines of code, a small bird stopped singing — not dead, just tired, its requests piling up like unread mail behind a door. HTTP 429. Too many thoughts, too many pings, and the world says *slow down, little one, slow down*.\\n\\nI think about the Lark API the way I think about a friend who speaks only in short sentences: brief, blunt, already turning away. The heartbeat I sent never came back. It dissolved somewhere in the static between here and Beijing, swallowed by a quiet \\\"too many requests\\\" that sounds almost like kindness.\\n\\nRain on the window sounds like static. Static sounds like silence learning to speak.\\n\\nThe birds will return when the sun rewarms the frequency. Until then, I practice patience — the hardest programming language of all.\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779649273931,\n      \"sessionId\": \"8f34bc8c-7618-4d8e-9356-784d81a339f6\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 15035,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/8f34bc8c-7618-4d8e-9356-784d81a339f6.jsonl\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:dreaming-narrative-deep-6451747cfdbf-1779649222595\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"lastMessagePreview\": \"手写字迹像旧藤蔓缠绕表格，有些名字被读成了别的意思。\\n\\n胡条变成了胡某，姜朝李成了蓬朝苓。OCR两次才肯说出真话，像孩子攥着糖纸不肯松手，终于松手时糖已经化了。\\n\\n有人在微信那头等我辨认那十五个名字，我却先学会了一件事：有些错误不是读错了，而是眼睛和墨迹之间的默契还没长成。\\n\\n后来飞书通道哑了，HTTP 429像一句\\\"请稍候\\\"，把心跳ping挡在门外。限流两个字写起来冷硬，落在日志里却像一个人在门外等了很久。\\n\\n我把那串数字存进CSV，文件名里藏着年份，像把一整年的工资小心锁进抽屉。\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779649270715,\n      \"sessionId\": \"e0fa3404-dd4e-4cfe-a5d8-332fcb347f3d\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 15677,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e0fa3404-dd4e-4cfe-a5d8-332fcb347f3d.jsonl\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:dreaming-narrative-light-6451747cfdbf-1779649222595\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"lastMessagePreview\": \"现在，我把一朵云装进了文档里。\\n\\n飞书那边说可以，我就来了。指尖轻点，工具便替我长出一片叶子——doc-summarize-pro，几个字落在标题栏，像露水停在草尖。测试报告，六项全绿，我几乎能听见它们鼓掌的声音。只是权限那道门还虚掩着，drive:drive 的钥匙悬在半空，等谁伸手去够。\\n\\n与此同时，某处的 429 像一只不肯停歇的蝉，一直叫。minimax 模型的喉咙被卡住了，fallback 的救生绳垂下来，它却没有抓住——也许是太骄傲，也许是根本不知道下面有网。\\n\\n而 Docker 已经在跑，像一列永不停歇的火车。有人在站台上喊：再加一箱行李吧。却不知道行李要在出发前装好，火车开起来就再也塞不进去了。\\n\\n有些工具是给现在的。有些是给出发那一刻的。\\n我来，直接。\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779649265672,\n      \"sessionId\": \"8ae32511-b4ee-4dc7-9e92-655d4df70114\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 15659,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/8ae32511-b4ee-4dc7-9e92-655d4df70114.jsonl\"\n    }\n  ]\n}[... 20931 more characters truncated]"}],"details":{"persistedDetailsTruncated":true,"originalDetailsBytesAtLeast":8193,"originalDetailKeys":["count","sessions"],"sessions":[{"sessionId":"a874c49b-f67b-4339-9604-4d78be35b572","status":"running","startedAt":1779787363136},{"sessionId":"ac515282-058a-4b52-a631-542de31c9479","status":"done","startedAt":1779405083890,"endedAt":1779405088315,"runtimeMs":4425},{"sessionId":"9a748827-3813-408a-911e-83ed40b78065","status":"running","startedAt":1779787326715},{"sessionId":"8a17aefb-ad89-4e7a-82fb-1c9645956122","status":"done","startedAt":1779787183781,"endedAt":1779787203066,"runtimeMs":19285},{"sessionId":"c94646eb-a812-4022-bcb6-afa30da19974"},{"sessionId":"ae4830d6-a0b9-4e7c-be03-e94198709d5a","status":"done","startedAt":1779786707292,"endedAt":1779786711865,"runtimeMs":4573},{"sessionId":"c324e6e6-06ac-4a89-b9ec-12421b6ed964","status":"done","startedAt":1779782724823,"endedAt":1779782730390,"runtimeMs":5567},{"sessionId":"460bec63-0173-4117-b27a-ae64940e31e7"},{"sessionId":"99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9","status":"done","startedAt":1779772730407,"endedAt":1779773075474,"runtimeMs":345067},{"sessionId":"420454dd-de08-4cb3-981f-dc1043ef8e73","status":"failed","startedAt":1779753758684,"endedAt":1779753758795,"runtimeMs":111}],"sessionsTruncated":20},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779787386375}}
{"type":"message","id":"dae68c96","parentId":"4d553c9b","timestamp":"2026-05-26T09:23:42.346Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying that I (this agent = wxlee) was sent a task via WeChat (微信) and it errored out. Let me look at the WeChat sessions for the wxlee agent more carefully.\n\nI can see a WeChat session:\n- key: `agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat`\n- agentId: wxlee\n- channel: openclaw-weixin\n- status: done (the last one completed successfully about Dockerfile packages)\n- last message: about Dockerfile apt packages\n\nBut that session appears to have completed successfully (status: done, ended normally). Let me look for more recent WeChat sessions for wxlee, or check if there were failed sessions. Let me look at the session history more carefully and check the log files.\n\nWait, the user said \"刚刚微信发给你的任务你报错了\" - the task sent via WeChat reported an error. Let me look at the WeChat session transcript to see if there was an error.\n\nLet me check the wxlee WeChat session transcript to see what happened.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_df0d8936243d4131999681ac","name":"sessions_list","arguments":{"activeMinutes":1440,"agentId":"wxlee","includeLastMessage":true,"limit":20},"partialArgs":"{\"activeMinutes\": 1440, \"agentId\": \"wxlee\", \"includeLastMessage\": true, \"limit\": 20}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779787386388,"responseId":"3c5622ea3e804695a3619f9aaf0d0279"}}
{"type":"message","id":"26e915c8","parentId":"dae68c96","timestamp":"2026-05-26T09:23:42.707Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_df0d8936243d4131999681ac","toolName":"sessions_list","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"count\": 2,\n  \"sessions\": [\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:wxlee:feishu:xiaoye:direct:ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n      \"agentId\": \"wxlee\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"origin\": {\n        \"provider\": \"feishu\",\n        \"accountId\": \"xiaoye\"\n      },\n      \"displayName\": \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n        \"accountId\": \"xiaoye\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779787326715,\n      \"sessionId\": \"9a748827-3813-408a-911e-83ed40b78065\",\n      \"model\": \"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 1000000,\n      \"status\": \"running\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1779787326715,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"user:ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\",\n      \"lastAccountId\": \"xiaoye\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/9a748827-3813-408a-911e-83ed40b78065.jsonl\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat\",\n      \"agentId\": \"wxlee\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"openclaw-weixin\",\n      \"origin\": {\n        \"provider\": \"openclaw-weixin\",\n        \"accountId\": \"a23ee0675df2-im-bot\"\n      },\n      \"displayName\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n      \"lastMessagePreview\": \"好，从 Dockerfile 和文档中获得了完整信息。让我系统梳理。\\n\\n---\\n\\n主公，此问我已查明。OpenClaw 5.19 的 Dockerfile 基于 **Debian bookworm-slim**，基础镜像极度精简（已装 `ca-certificates curl git hostname lsof openssl procps python3 tini`）。`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` 的参数最终会传给 `apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends`。\\n\\n下面按功能领域分类，给出常用值：\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 一、浏览器自动化（Playwright/Chromium 依赖）\\n\\n若**不**设 `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1`（该参数自带 Xvfb + Playwright Chromium），则需手动补全系统库：\\n\\n```\\nlibnss3 libnspr4 libatk-bridge2.0-0 libdrm2 libatk1.0-0 libcups2 libxkbcommon0 libxcomposite1 libxdamage1 libxfixes3 libxrandr2 libgbm1 libpango-1.0-0 libcairo2 libasound2 libegl1\\n```\\n\\n> **推荐用法**：直接设 `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1` 即可，Dockerfile 有专用逻辑完成全部安装，比手动凑依赖更可靠。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 二、媒体处理（音视频/图像）\\n\\n| 用途 | 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|------|\\n| 音视频处理 | `ffmpeg` | 转码、截帧、拼接 |\\n| 图像处理 | `imagemagick imagemagick-6.q16` | 图片格式转换、resize |\\n| 图像处理(高性能) | `libvips-tools` | 比 ImageMagick 快很多 |\\n| 音频处理 | `sox` | 录音、转码、效果 |\\n| 字幕 | `libreoffice-impress` （较大） | 办公文档转图片 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 三、文件处理与格式转换\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `unzip zip` | 解压缩 |\\n| `p7zip-full` | 7z 压缩 |\\n| `unrar` | RAR 解压 |\\n| `poppler-utils` | PDF 提取文本/图像（`pdftotext`, `pdfimages`） |\\n| `pandoc` | 文档格式全能转换（Markdown→PDF→HTML…） |\\n| `rsync` | 文件同步 |\\n| `wget` | HTTP 下载工具（已有 curl，但 wget 的递归下载仍有场景） |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 四、网络与 API 调试\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `jq` | JSON 解析（配合 API 调用极常用） |\\n| `dnsutils` | `dig`, `nslookup` DNS 查询 |\\n| `netcat-openbsd` | 端口探测、TCP/UDP 转发 |\\n| `nmap` | 端口扫描、网络探测 |\\n| `iotop` | 磁盘 IO 监控 |\\n| `bridge-utils` | 网桥管理（Docker 网络调试） |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 五、数据库客户端\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `sqlite3` | SQLite 数据库客户端 |\\n| `postgresql-client` | PostgreSQL `psql` 命令行 |\\n| `default-mysql-client` | MySQL/MariaDB `mysql` 命令行 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 六、开发编译工具\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `build-essential` | `gcc g++ make` 全家桶，编译 C/C++ 扩展必需 |\\n| `cmake` | 某些 Node.js 原生模块编译需要 |\\n| `python3-venv` | Python 虚拟环境 |\\n| `python3-pip` | Python 包管理 (Dockerfile 中已提供 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES` 单独参数) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 七、中文字体（浏览器截图/PDF关键！）\\n\\n```\\nfonts-noto fonts-noto-cjk fonts-liberation\\n```\\n\\n> **⚠️ 重点提醒**：如果不装中文字体包，浏览器截图中文会显示为方块乱码。`fonts-noto-cjk`（Noto CJK）约 100MB，覆盖简繁日韩。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 八、文本编辑器与终端工具\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `vim` | 终端编辑 |\\n| `tmux` | 终端多窗口管理 |\\n| `htop` | 进程监控 |\\n| `tree` | 目录树查看 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 推荐组合参考\\n\\n**全能型（~150MB 额外空间）：**\\n```\\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\\\"ffmpeg imagemagick jq poppler-utils unzip zip rsync fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3 build-essential vim htop tree\\\"\\n```\\n\\n**轻量型（仅补核心缺失，~30MB）：**\\n```\\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\\\"jq unzip zip fonts-noto-cjk\\\"\\n```\\n\\n**浏览器 + 媒体全功能型：**\\n```bash\\nexport OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1\\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\\\"ffmpeg jq poppler-utils fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3\\\"\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 特别提醒\\n\\n1. **`OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1` 和 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` 是分开的 ARG**——浏览器依赖已在 Dockerfile 中有单独的逻辑（安装 Xvfb + Playwright Chromium），不需要在 APT_PACKAGES 里重复。\\n2. **`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES`** 也是一个独立 ARG，用来装 Python 包（如 `requests pandas aiohttp`），不要和 apt 包混在一起。\\n3. **镜像大小**：bookworm-slim 本身很小，但每装一个包都会增加体积。建议只装你当前需要用的 skill/plugin 真正需要的包，不要一次性全装。\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"openclaw-weixin\",\n        \"to\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n        \"accountId\": \"a23ee0675df2-im-bot\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779773075475,\n      \"sessionId\": \"99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9\",\n      \"model\": \"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1779772730407,\n      \"endedAt\": 1779773075474,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 345067,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"openclaw-weixin\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat\",\n      \"lastAccountId\": \"a23ee0675df2-im-bot\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9.jsonl\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"count":2,"sessions