rfile 中有单独的逻辑（安装 Xvfb + Playwright Chromium），不需要在 APT_PACKAGES 里重复。\n2. **`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES`** 也是一个独立 ARG，用来装 Python 包（如 `requests pandas aiohttp`），不要和 apt 包混在一起。\n3. **镜像大小**：bookworm-slim 本身很小，但每装一个包都会增加体积。建议只装你当前需要用的 skill/plugin 真正需要的包，不要一次性全装。","deliveryContext":{"channel":"openclaw-weixin","to":"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat","accountId":"a23ee0675df2-im-bot"},"updatedAt":1779773075475,"sessionId":"99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","status":"done","startedAt":1779772730407,"endedAt":1779773075474,"runtimeMs":345067,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"openclaw-weixin","lastTo":"o9cq802UVmvEGGP0xkFm4O7AcdRg@im.wechat","lastAccountId":"a23ee0675df2-im-bot","transcriptPath":"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9.jsonl"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779787422686}}
