T id=\\\\\\\"6b72b2c650133a3c\\\\\\\">>>\\\\nSource: Web Search\\\\n---\\\\nDocker /Podman: add OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES as the runtime-neutral image build arg for extra apt packages while keeping OPENCLAW_DOCKER_APT_PACKAGES as a legacy fallback. (#62431) Thanks @urtabajev.\\\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"6b72b2c650133a3c\\\\\\\">>>\\\",\\n      \\\"siteName\\\": \\\"newreleases.io\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"\\\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"b6c63196c8d126f5\\\\\\\">>>\\\\nSource: Web Search\\\\n---\\\\nOpenClaw openclaw 2026.5.19-beta.1 Release\\\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"b6c63196c8d126f5\\\\\\\">>>\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://svrforum.com/itnews/3109061\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"\\\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"014889d108c4e5af\\\\\\\">>>\\\\nSource: Web Search\\\\n---\\\\nDocker /Podman: add OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES as the runtime-neutral image build arg for extra apt packages while keeping OPENCLAW_DOCKER_APT_PACKAGES as a legacy fallback. (#62431) Thanks @urtabajev.\\\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"014889d108c4e5af\\\\\\\">>>\\\",\\n      \\\"siteName\\\": \\\"svrforum.com\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"\\\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"9f14cdd161522c0d\\\\\\\">>>\\\\nSource: Web Search\\\\n---\\\\nOpenClaw v2026.5.19-beta.1 - 更新日志\\\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"9f14cdd161522c0d\\\\\\\">>>\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://news.daheiai.com/changelog_detail.php?id=OpenClaw%3A324617821\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"\\\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"3540e91d3e966d0d\\\\\\\">>>\\\\nSource: Web Search\\\\n---\\\\n## 2026. 5.19 ### 变更 - 代理：明确修复应默认为干净的重构、精简内部实现，并为插件 SDK/API 提供明确的弃用路径。 - 依赖：将 `@ openclaw /proxyline` 更新至 0.3.3。 - 依赖：将 Pi 软件包更新至 0.75.1，并将最低支持的 Node.js 22 系列提升至 22.19。 - Docker /Podman：新增 ` OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES ` 作为运行时无关的镜像 ...\\\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"3540e91d3e966d0d\\\\\\\">>>\\\",\\n      \\\"siteName\\\": \\\"news.daheiai.com\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"\\\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"ce5daf3bb68fbd95\\\\\\\">>>\\\\nSource: Web Search\\\\n---\\\\nOpenClaw v2026.5.19-beta.1 发布:Android 语音模式全新升级、QA-Lab 测试体系大幅…\\\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"ce5daf3bb68fbd95\\\\\\\">>>\\\",\\n      \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.yeyulingfeng.com/603270.html\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"\\\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"be8d5d409ae977bb\\\\\\\">>>\\\\nSource: Web Search\\\\n---\\\\n新增功能 • Agents：明确修复工作默认采用简洁的有界重构，倾向于精简内部实现，并为插件 SDK/API 废弃路径提供明确方案。 • 依赖更新： @ openclaw /proxyline 升级至 0.3.3。 • 依赖更新：Pi 包升级至 0.75.1，并将最低支持的 Node.js 版本提升至 22.19。 • Docker /Podman：新增 OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES 作为运行时 ...\\\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"be8d5d409ae977bb\\\\\\\">>>\\\",\\n      \\\"siteName\\\": \\\"www.yeyulingfeng.com\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\"}],\"details\":{\"query\":\"openclaw docker \\\"OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES\\\" \\\"5.19\\\" apt packages browser\",\"provider\":\"duckduckgo\",\"count\":4,\"tookMs\":1077,\"externalContent\":{\"untrusted\":true,\"source\":\"web_search\",\"provider\":\"duckduckgo\",\"wrapped\":true},\"results\":[{\"title\":\"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8dbb6df63e9a0fa9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nopenclaw/openclaw v2026.5.19 on GitHub - NewReleases.io\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT \n\n⚠️ [... middle content omitted — showing head and tail ...]\n\ntories.\\\\n# NOTE: /home/node/.config must be created with node ownership first so that\\\\n# the leaf /home/node/.config/openclaw inherits the correct parent permissions.\\\\n# Without this, install -d leaves /home/node/.config as root:root (issue #85968).\\\\nRUN install -d -m 0755 -o node -g node /home/node/.config && \\\\\\\\\\\\n    install -d -m 0700 -o node -g node \\\\\\\\\\\\n      /home/node/.openclaw \\\\\\\\\\\\n      /home/node/.openclaw/workspace \\\\\\\\\\\\n      /home/node/.config/openclaw && \\\\\\\\\\\\n    stat -c '%U:%G %a' /home/node/.openclaw | grep -qx 'node:node 700' && \\\\\\\\\\\\n    stat -c '%U:%G %a' /home/node/.openclaw/workspace | grep -qx 'node:node 700' && \\\\\\\\\\\\n    stat -c '%U:%G %a' /home/node/.config | grep -qx 'node:node 755' && \\\\\\\\\\\\n    stat -c '%U:%G %a' /home/node/.config/openclaw | grep -qx 'node:node 700'\\\\n\\\\nENV NODE_ENV=production\\\\n\\\\n# Security hardening: Run as non-root user\\\\n# The node:24-bookworm image includes a 'node' user (uid 1000)\\\\n# This reduces the attack surface by preventing container escape via root privileges\\\\nUSER node\\\\n\\\\n# Start gateway server with default config.\\\\n# Binds to loopback (127.0.0.1) by default for security.\\\\n#\\\\n# IMPORTANT: With Docker bridge networking (-p 18789:18789), loopback bind\\\\n# makes the gateway unreachable from the host. Either:\\\\n#   - Use --network host, OR\\\\n#   - Override --bind to \\\\\\\"lan\\\\\\\" (0.0.0.0) and set auth credentials\\\\n#\\\\n# Built-in probe endpoints for container health checks:\\\\n#   - GET /healthz (liveness) and GET /readyz (readiness)\\\\n#   - aliases: /health and /ready\\\\n# For external access from host/ingress, override bind to \\\\\\\"lan\\\\\\\" and set auth.\\\\nHEALTHCHECK --interval=3m --timeout=10s --start-period=15s --retries=3 \\\\\\\\\\\\n  CMD node -e \\\\\\\"fetch('http://127.0.0.1:18789/healthz').then((r)=>process.exit(r.ok?0:1)).catch(()=>process.exit(1))\\\\\\\"\\\\nENTRYPOINT [\\\\\\\"tini\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"-s\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"--\\\\\\\"]\\\\nCMD [\\\\\\\"node\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"openclaw.mjs\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"gateway\\\\\\\"]\\\\n\\\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\\\\\"22898cc2ceb9082e\\\\\\\">>>\\\"\\n}[... 3964 more characters truncated]\"}],\"details\":{\"persistedDetailsTruncated\":true,\"originalDetailsBytesAtLeast\":8193,\"originalDetailKeys\":[\"url\",\"finalUrl\",\"status\",\"contentType\",\"title\",\"extractMo