{"type":"message","id":"311c341a","parentId":"c255a937","timestamp":"2026-05-26T09:25:49.348Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full picture. The user says \"刚刚微信发给你的任务你报错了，查一查\" - meaning \"The task I sent you via WeChat just now reported an error, go check it.\"\n\nFrom the session transcript I'm reading, this is the WeChat session `agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat` (sessionId: `99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9`).\n\nLooking at the transcript, the last message in that session has a `\"stopReason\":\"error\"` and `\"errorMessage\":\"request timed out\"` at around line 25-33 (the assistant timed out while researching about Playwright dependencies).\n\nSo the error was: **request timed out** — the model processing the WeChat message ran out of time while researching OpenClaw Docker APT packages, and the response was never completed. It failed after several tool calls, eventually timing out with no final answer delivered back to the user.\n\nLet me look at the rest of the transcript to confirm.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f19ed406fefd4edbbe3bab55","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":34,"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9.jsonl"},"partialArgs":"{\"offset\": 34, \"path\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9.jsonl\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779787471341,"responseId":"06c3b6d1f92d4d259b9e21f5ad3a2f1d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"8c6be44e","parentId":"311c341a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T09:25:49.361Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_f19ed406fefd4edbbe3bab55","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"e6f87df5\",\"parentId\":\"afd9f912\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-26T05:19:23.866Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_955e973d0aa743ee8c7a9b89\",\"toolName\":\"web_search\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"error\\\",\\n  \\\"tool\\\": \\\"web_search\\\",\\n  \\\"error\\\": \\\"DuckDuckGo returned a bot-detection challenge.\\\"\\n}\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"error\",\"tool\":\"web_search\",\"error\":\"DuckDuckGo returned a bot-detection challenge.\"},\"isError\":true,\"timestamp\":1779772763865}}\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"e88c74ec\",\"parentId\":\"e6f87df5\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-26T05:24:35.473Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"Now I have a very clear picture. Let me summarize what I found from the Dockerfile and docs.\\n\\nThe OpenClaw Docker image uses `bookworm-slim` as its base, which is very minimal. It already installs these core packages:\\n- ca-certificates, curl, git, hostname, lsof, openssl, procps, python3, tini\\n\\nThe `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` ARG is used in a RUN command that does `apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends $packages`.\\n\\nI also see that there are separate dedicated build args:\\n- `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1` - installs Xvfb + Playwright Chromium\\n- `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_DOCKER_CLI=1` - installs Docker CLI\\n\\nSo `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` is for general system packages that aren't covered by the dedicated args. Let me now compile the comprehensive list of useful packages.\\n\\nHere's my analysis of what packages would be useful for different use cases:\\n\\n**Browser Automation** (if NOT using OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER):\\nPlaywright/Chromium needs many system libraries\\n\\n**Audio/Video Processing**:\\n- ffmpeg\\n- sox\\n\\n**Image Processing**:\\n- imagemagick\\n- libvips-tools\\n\\n**File Processing**:\\n- unzip, zip, unrar\\n- poppler-utils (PDF)\\n- pandoc\\n\\n**Networking/API**:\\n- jq, yq\\n- netcat-openbsd\\n- dnsutils\\n- nmap\\n\\n**Database**:\\n- sqlite3\\n- postgresql-client\\n- mysql-client (default-mysql-client)\\n\\n**Development Tools**:\\n- build-essential (compiling packages)\\n- gcc, g++\\n- make\\n- cmake\\n\\n**Python extras** (better to use PIP):\\n- Already has python3, but can add python3-pip, python3-venv\\n\\n**Fonts (for browser/PDF rendering)**:\\n- fonts-noto\\n- fonts-noto-cjk\\n- fonts-liberation\\n\\n**Monitoring/Debugging**:\\n- htop, iotop\\n- strace, ltrace\\n- net-tools\\n- vim, nano, tmux\\n\\nLet me organize this nicely for the user.\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"reasoning_content\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"好，从 Dockerfile 和文档中获得了完整信息。让我系统梳理。\\n\\n---\\n\\n主公，此问我已查明。OpenClaw 5.19 的 Dockerfile 基于 **Debian bookworm-slim**，基础镜像极度精简（已装 `ca-certificates curl git hostname lsof openssl procps python3 tini`）。`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` 的参数最终会传给 `apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends`。\\n\\n下面按功能领域分类，给出常用值：\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 一、浏览器自动化（Playwright/Chromium 依赖）\\n\\n若**不**设 `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1`（该参数自带 Xvfb + Playwright Chromium），则需手动补全系统库：\\n\\n```\\nlibnss3 libnspr4 libatk-bridge2.0-0 libdrm2 libatk1.0-0 libcups2 libxkbcommon0 libxcomposite1 libxdamage1 libxfixes3 libxrandr2 libgbm1 libpango-1.0-0 libcairo2 libasound2 libegl1\\n```\\n\\n> **推荐用法**：直接设 `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1` 即可，Dockerfile 有专用逻辑完成全部安装，比手动凑依赖更可靠。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 二、媒体处理（音视频/图像）\\n\\n| 用途 | 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|------|\\n| 音视频处理 | `ffmpeg` | 转码、截帧、拼接 |\\n| 图像处理 | `imagemagick imagemagick-6.q16` | 图片格式转换、resize |\\n| 图像处理(高性能) | `libvips-tools` | 比 ImageMagick 快很多 |\\n| 音频处理 | `sox` | 录音、转码、效果 |\\n| 字幕 | `libreoffice-impress` （较大） | 办公文档转图片 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 三、文件处理与格式转换\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `unzip zip` | 解压缩 |\\n| `p7zip-full` | 7z 压缩 |\\n| `unrar` | RAR 解压 |\\n| `poppler-utils` | PDF 提取文本/图像（`pdftotext`, `pdfimages`） |\\n| `pandoc` | 文档格式全能转换（Markdown→PDF→HTML…） |\\n| `rsync` | 文件同步 |\\n| `wget` | HTTP 下载工具（已有 curl，但 wget 的递归下载仍有场景） |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 四、网络与 API 调试\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `jq` | JSON 解析（配合 API 调用极常用） |\\n| `dnsutils` | `dig`, `nslookup` DNS 查询 |\\n| `netcat-openbsd` | 端口探测、TCP/UDP 转发 |\\n| `nmap` | 端口扫描、网络探测 |\\n| `iotop` | 磁盘 IO 监控 |\\n| `bridge-utils` | 网桥管理（Docker 网络调试） |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 五、数据库客户端\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `sqlite3` | SQLite 数据库客户端 |\\n| `postgresql-client` | PostgreSQL `psql` 命令行 |\\n| `default-mysql-client` | MySQL/MariaDB `mysql` 命令行 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 六、开发编译工具\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `build-essential` | `gcc g++ make` 全家桶，编译 C/C++ 扩展必需 |\\n| `cmake` | 某些 Node.js 原生模块编译需要 |\\n| `python3-venv` | Python 虚拟环境 |\\n| `python3-pip` | Python 包管理 (Dockerfile 中已提供 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES` 单独参数) |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 七、中文字体（浏览器截图/PDF关键！）\\n\\n```\\nfonts-noto fonts-noto-cjk fonts-liberation\\n```\\n\\n> **⚠️ 重点提醒**：如果不装中文字体包，浏览器截图中文会显示为方块乱码。`fonts-noto-cjk`（Noto CJK）约 100MB，覆盖简繁日韩。\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 八、文本编辑器与终端工具\\n\\n| 包名 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `vim` | 终端编辑 |\\n| `tmux` | 终端多窗口管理 |\\n| `htop` | 进程监控 |\\n| `tree` | 目录树查看 |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 推荐组合参考\\n\\n**全能型（~150MB 额外空间）：**\\n```\\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\\\"ffmpeg imagemagick jq poppler-utils unzip zip rsync fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3 build-essential vim htop tree\\\"\\n```\\n\\n**轻量型（仅补核心缺失，~30MB）：**\\n```\\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\\\"jq unzip zip fonts-noto-cjk\\\"\\n```\\n\\n**浏览器 + 媒体全功能型：**\\n```bash\\nexport OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1\\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\\\"ffmpeg jq poppler-utils fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3\\\"\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 特别提醒\\n\\n1. **`OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1` 和 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` 是分开的 ARG**——浏览器依赖已在 Dockerfile 中有单独的逻辑（安装 Xvfb + Playwright Chromium），不需要在 APT_PACKAGES 里重复。\\n2. **`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES`** 也是一个独立 ARG，用来装 Python 包（如 `requests pandas aiohttp`），不要和 apt 包混在一起。\\n3. **镜像大小**：bookworm-slim 本身很小，但每装一个包都会增加体积。建议只装你当前需要用的 skill/plugin 真正需要的包，不要一次性全装。\"}],\"api\":\"openai-completions\",\"provider\":\"nvidia\",\"model\":\"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash\",\"usage\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":0,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1779772763873,\"responseId\":\"72aa93c1eca647228bdf231ff96e2f14\"}}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779787549358}}
{"type":"message","id":"3dc1d325","parentId":"8c6be44e","timestamp":"2026-05-26T09:28:02.395Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the full picture. The WeChat session with agent `wxlee` received a question about `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` and the response was very detailed and correct. The response was successfully sent (status \"done\"). \n\nBut the user says there was an error. Let me check more carefully. The session transcript shows:\n1. The user asked about `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` for OpenClaw 5.19\n2. The assistant started working on it with multiple tool calls\n3. Looking at the status, it shows `status: \"done\"` and `endedAt: 1779773075474`, which means it completed successfully\n\nBut wait - looking more carefully at the transcript, I see some tool calls completed and then there was a request timed out error at line `852bb0dc`:\n```\n\"stopReason\":\"error\"\n\"errorMessage\":\"request timed out\"\n```\n\nThen the assistant continued and recovered, making more tool calls and ultimately delivering a successful response. The final response at the end shows `stopReason: \"stop\"` with the complete answer.\n\nSo the response was eventually delivered. But the user said it \"报错了\" (reported an error). Let me look at the session from a different angle - maybe the error was in the user's actual WeChat channel that I can't see from the transcript.\n\nWait, this is the wxlee agent. The user said \"刚刚微信发给你的任务\" - \"the task I sent you via WeChat just now\". This session (`agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat`) is the WeChat session for the wxlee agent (which is me, xiaoye/军师).\n\nLooking at the WeChat session transcript more carefully:\n- The user's question was at 05:09 UTC (13:09 Beijing time)\n- The assistant started working on it at 05:10\n- At 05:14:37, there was a timeout error (`request timed out`) \n- But then at 05:15:40 and 05:16:00, more tool calls were made\n- Finally at 05:19:23, more tool calls\n- At 05:24:35, the final response was delivered\n\nActually wait - the user is saying they're in this Feishu chat (ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50) and mentioning a task sent via WeChat. This means the user is NOT Lucifer (the main account ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff), but someone else.\n\nLet me check - this user `ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50` is the one who said \"嗨\" earlier and I asked how to address them. Now they're saying the WeChat task had an error.\n\nLooking at the WeChat session transcript again - in lines 26-33 of the transcript, there's a `request timed out` error after some tool calls. Then the assistant recovered and produced the final response. But the error occurred during processing.\n\nActually, looking at the full flow:\n1. User asked about OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES\n2. Assistant started researching\n3. Some tool calls succeeded\n4. At `05:14:37`, there was a timeout error (`stopReason: \"error\"`, `errorMessage: \"request timed out\"`)\n5. Then at `05:14:52`, the assistant started again with new tool calls\n6. At `05:18:48`, another timeout error\n7. At `05:19:23`, continued with more tool calls\n8. At `05:24:35`, the final complete response was delivered\n\nSo there were intermittent timeout errors during processing, but the final answer was delivered. However, from the user's perspective on WeChat, they might have seen error messages or the bot might have shown errors.\n\nActually wait, let me re-read the JSONL more carefully. The session shows:\n- The user's question was received\n- The assistant started responding with multiple tool calls\n- Tool results came back\n- Then at some point, the model call timed out with \"request timed out\"\n- But the assistant recovered and continued\n\nActually in OpenClaw's architecture, when a model call timed out during tool execution, the user would likely see the partial response. The user might have seen the error message \"⚠️ Something went wrong while processing your request\" on WeChat.\n\nLet me check if there's an error log or more details to find. Let me look at the gateway logs for this specific session.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公，让我查一下微信通道"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b6bc4c0e3a874afaa27a293e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -r \"1779772763873\\|72aa93c1eca647228b231ff96e2f14\\|99e5eec8\" /home/node/.openclaw/logs/ 2>/dev/null | tail -30","timeout":10},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"grep -r \\\"1779772763873\\\\|72aa93c1eca647228b231ff96e2f14\\\\|99e5eec8\\\" /home/node/.openclaw/logs/ 2>/dev/null | tail -30\", \"timeout\": 10}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779787549362,"responseId":"e4d90f8f853a495a9caddeea92d3fd6d"}}
