{"type":"message","id":"39c72845","parentId":"c360c22f","timestamp":"2026-05-26T09:31:02.306Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me look at the session transcript more carefully. The session `99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9` is from **openclaw-weixin** channel. Looking at the transcript, the session started at `2026-05-26T05:09:57.131Z` (UTC), which is 13:09 Beijing time.\n\nThe last message shows an assistant response with `stopReason: \"stop\"` at `timestamp: 1779772763873`, which was the final successful response - the comprehensive guide about `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`.\n\nSo actually, the session appears to have completed successfully! The final response was sent to the WeChat user. But wait, the user (current Feishu user ou_9e18...) is saying \"刚刚微信发给你的任务你报错了\" - meaning the task sent via WeChat to me reported an error.\n\nLet me look more carefully at the transcript. There was a timeout error at the end of one of the message sequences. Let me re-read:\n\nAt line 25 area:\n```\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"852bb0dc\",\"parentId\":\"4fc510d5\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-26T05:14:37.044Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[],\"api\":\"openai-completions\",\"provider\":\"nvidia\",\"model\":\"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash\",\"usage\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":0,\"cost\":{\"input\":0,\"output\":0,\"cacheRead\":0,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0}},\"stopReason\":\"error\",\"timestamp\":1779772357026,\"errorMessage\":\"request timed out\"}}\n```\n\nSo there was a tool call that timed out (the web_search was blocked). But then at lines 34+:\n```\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"e6f87df5\",...} -> web_search error\n{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"e88c74ec\",...} -> final successful response!\n```\n\nThe final assistant response at `timestamp: 1779772763873` completed with `stopReason: \"stop\"` and had a comprehensive response. The session ended at `1779773075475` which was a `\"endedAt\"` value.\n\nActually, let me re-read the session data more carefully:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"key\": \"agent:wxlee:openclaw-weixin:a23ee0675df2-im-bot:direct:o9cq802uvmveggp0xkfm4o7acdrg@im.wechat\",\n  ...\n  \"updatedAt\": 1779773075475,\n  \"sessionId\": \"99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9\",\n  \"model\": \"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"startedAt\": 1779772730407,\n  \"endedAt\": 1779773075474,\n  \"runtimeMs\": 345067,\n  \"systemSent\": true,\n  \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nThe session status is \"done\" and it ended normally with `abortedLastRun: false`. The last message from the session was the comprehensive response about APT packages.\n\nBut there WAS an intermediate error - a timeout on the first assistant response attempt (`stopReason: \"error\"`, `errorMessage: \"request timed out\"`). However, the model retried (you can see the next assistant message with id `29cb420b` continued the work) and eventually completed.\n\nSo, the issue might be that the WeChat user got an error message (the timeout error), and then the final response. Let me check - in the OpenClaw WeChat channel, when a model times out, does it send an error to the user? Or does the user only see the final response?\n\nThe session shows the assistant response with error at `1779772357026` (content: `[]`, empty content), and then another run continues from `1779772479063`. So during the first run, the model timed out. In the session, the user likely saw the initial partial response (which was \"主公，此问涉及镜像构建配置，待我查一下文档以给出准确答案\") and then nothing happened for a while.\n\nActually, wait - looking at the session data more carefully, the first response had partial content:\n```json\n{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\n  [{\"type\":\"thinking\",...},\n   {\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"主公，此问涉及镜像构建配置，待我查一下文档以给出准确答案\"},\n   {\"type\":\"toolCall\",...},\n   {\"type\":\"toolCall\",...}\n  ],\n  \"stopReason\":\"toolUse\"\n}\n```\n\nSo the initial response was streamed (text message + tool calls), then the tool results came back, then the next assistant response timed out. The important thing is: the WeChat user probably already saw \"主公，此问涉及镜像构建配置，待我查一下文档以给出准确答案\" and then nothing happened for a while, then later got the full response.\n\nOR - if the initial message wasn't fully sent (since it was followed by tool calls), the user might have only seen a generic error or nothing at all.\n\nLet me check what actually was returned to the WeChat user. Let me check the actual WeChat message delivery status.\n\nActually, let me look at the logs to find out what happened with this WeChat message delivery.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5f4ee6e06e6d4b6ea9e03fc2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/node/.openclaw/logs -name \"*.log\" -newer /home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9.jsonl 2>/dev/null | head -5","timeout":5},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"find /home/node/.openclaw/logs -name \\\"*.log\\\" -newer /home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9.jsonl 2>/dev/null | head -5\", \"timeout\": 5}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_58df469b9c184aaba9ab71bc","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la ~/.openclaw/logs/ 2>/dev/null | tail -10","timeout":5},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"ls -la ~/.openclaw/logs/ 2>/dev/null | tail -10\", \"timeout\": 5}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779787740852,"responseId":"b3d02d2947f14bdc823eb68b65a0d598"}}
