{"type":"message","id":"27c81733","parentId":"03f5527d","timestamp":"2026-05-26T10:59:09.324Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to re-generate the answer that was originally sent to WeChat but experienced a timeout error. The original question was about what common values can be used for `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` in OpenClaw 5.19 to make it more feature-complete.\n\nFrom the session transcript I already read, I can see the complete answer that was generated on the second attempt. Let me reconstruct the full answer since I already have all the information from the transcript.\n\nActually, looking back at the transcript I already read, the full answer was already generated and sent successfully on the second attempt. The answer covered:\n1. Browser automation dependencies\n2. Media processing (audio/video/images)\n3. File processing & format conversion\n4. Network & API debugging\n5. Database clients\n6. Development tools\n7. Chinese fonts\n8. Text editors & terminal tools\nPlus recommended combinations.\n\nLet me just re-deliver that comprehensive answer.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公稍等，我从微信日志中把原"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fba4cc63237b49ad831c11fb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -rn \"OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES\" /home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9.jsonl | wc -l","timeout":5},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"grep -rn \\\"OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES\\\" /home/node/.openclaw/agents/wxlee/sessions/99e5eec8-58e3-49b0-8e8f-095e1ff43eb9.jsonl | wc -l\", \"timeout\": 5}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779793120152,"responseId":"4ac98a726c214019a4f5927e7ded4579"}}
