{"type":"message","id":"8da61939","parentId":"88d71411","timestamp":"2026-05-26T11:01:14.428Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I already have the full answer from reading the transcript earlier. Let me reconstruct it properly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公，原问答案如下：\n\n---\n\n**OpenClaw 5.19 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` 推荐清单**\n\nDocker 镜像基于 Debian **bookworm-slim**，已预装 `ca-certificates curl git hostname lsof openssl procps python3 tini`。以下按功能分类推荐：\n\n---\n\n**一、浏览器自动化**（推荐直接用 `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1`，它自带 Xvfb + Playwright Chromium 完整逻辑）\n\n若确实需要手动补：\n```\nlibnss3 libnspr4 libatk-bridge2.0-0 libdrm2 libatk1.0-0 libcups2 libxkbcommon0 libxcomposite1 libxdamage1 libxfixes3 libxrandr2 libgbm1 libpango-1.0-0 libcairo2 libasound2 libegl1\n```\n\n---\n\n**二、媒体处理**\n\n| 用途 | 包名 |\n|------|------|\n| 音视频 | `ffmpeg` |\n| 图像处理 | `imagemagick` |\n| 高性能图像 | `libvips-tools` |\n| 音频 | `sox` |\n\n---\n\n**三、文件处理**\n\n`unzip zip` — 解压缩\n`poppler-utils` — PDF 提取（`pdftotext`、`pdfimages`）\n`pandoc` — 文档格式全能转换\n`rsync` — 文件同步\n\n---\n\n**四、网络 & 调试**\n\n`jq` — JSON 解析（极常用）\n`dnsutils` — `dig`、`nslookup`\n`netcat-openbsd` — 端口探测\n`nmap` — 网络探测\n\n---\n\n**五、数据库客户端**\n\n`sqlite3` / `postgresql-client` / `default-mysql-client`\n\n---\n\n**六、开发编译**\n\n`build-essential` — gcc/g++/make 全家桶\n`python3-venv` — Python 虚拟环境\n→ Python 包建议用 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES` 装，不要混入 apt\n\n---\n\n**七、中文字体（⚠️ 截图/PDF 必装，否则中文变方块）**\n\n```\nfonts-noto fonts-noto-cjk fonts-liberation\n```\n\n---\n\n**八、推荐组合**\n\n**轻量型（~30MB）：**\n```bash\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"jq unzip zip fonts-noto-cjk\"\n```\n\n**全能型（~150MB）：**\n```bash\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"ffmpeg imagemagick jq poppler-utils unzip zip rsync fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3 build-essential vim htop tree\"\n```\n\n**浏览器 + 媒体全功能：**\n```bash\nexport OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"ffmpeg jq poppler-utils fonts-noto-cjk sqlite3\"\n```\n\n---\n\n> ⚠️ 注意：`OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1` 和 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES` 是独立 build arg，别和 APT_PACKAGES 混用。按需取用，不要一次全装。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779793149418,"responseId":"85d0bddbb5f7450ba752467e32d72d75"}}
